  "description": "ESKUTE T300 Pro Electric Trike for Adults, 998.4Wh Long-Range Battery, 1200W Peak Motor, 20\"x4.0\" Fat Tires, Foldable 3-Wheel Butterfly Handlebar E-Bike with Storage Bags, Gifts for parent\n\nRevolutionary Comfort: Say goodbye to riding discomfort. The unique Butterfly Handlebar encourages a relaxed, upright posture, allowing you to change hand positions to prevent numbness and fatigue. Paired with the height-adjustable seat and supportive backrest, you can ride for hours in complete comfort.\n\nGo Farther Than Ever: At the heart of the T300 Pro is a high-capacity 48V 20.8Ah removable lithium-ion battery. Unlock up to 80 miles of riding freedom, drastically reducing charging frequency and empowering you to explore your world without limits.\n\nRide with Supreme Confidence: Conquer any urban landscape or gentle path with ease. The massive 20\" x 4.0\" fat tires offer unparalleled stability and traction, while the robust three-wheel design with a low step-thru frame ensures easy mounting and a rock-solid feel on every journey.\n\nCarry Everything You Need: Designed for practicality, the T300 Pro features a sturdy front basket and a generously sized rear rack complete with removable storage bags. This dynamic duo provides ample space for your groceries, backpack, or even your furry friend, making it the ultimate utility vehicle for daily life.\n\nEffortless Maneuvering at Your Fingertips: Parking and navigating tight spaces have never been easier. With the intuitive one-button reverse function, you can back up smoothly at the touch of a button – no awkward pushing or straining required. Whether you're backing out of a garage or turning around in a narrow alley, this smart feature puts you in full control with zero hassle.\n\nSimplified Riding Experience: Whether you prefer the full-electric thrill of the twist throttle, the balanced exercise of pedal-assist, or traditional pedaling, the T300 Pro adapts to your mood and energy. The powerful 500W (1200W Peak) brushless motor provides smooth, quiet assistance for climbing hills, and the folding mechanism allows for compact storage in closets, car trunks, or apartments.",
